@base = http://localhost:5086

### Read user + tasks with Include
GET {{base}}/api/users/1/tasks

### Read three levels with ThenInclude
GET {{base}}/api/users/1/details

### Read complete graph (Tasks, Comments, Tags)
GET {{base}}/api/users/1/graph

### Compare with lightweight projection
GET {{base}}/api/users/1/summary

### Assign tag 3 to task 1 (204), repeat is also 204
POST {{base}}/api/tasks/1/tags/3

### Missing user yields 404
GET {{base}}/api/users/999/graph
